title: "JIT Reflex: a frozen chunking policy's own Jacobian as a feedback controller between its calls"
abstract: "Phase A: linearizing a frozen flow-matching action-chunking policy between its calls, tested on 12 Kinetix levels against Real-Time Chunking. Pre-registered offline kill-test (E1/E1b), closed-loop evaluation (E2) and a research agenda."
